    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your foe drives his weapon in between your ribs, ripping into one lung which collapses. You find yourself desperately short of breath.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Fatigued] (3). For healing purposes, count as @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.eWPN3CV2Eddwz8aM]{Torn Muscle (Major)}, with partial healing reducing your Conditions from @Condition[Fatigued] (3) to @Condition[Fatigued] (1) which will be removed once fully healed.</p>"
